{"children":[{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"In a world where one wrong click leads down the Ethereum rabbit hole, "From Normie to Noun" tells the story of an ordinary character undergoing a surreal crypto transformation.

This visual captures the precise moment of “met(h)amorphosis” when DeFi exposure, mETH yield, and the influence of NounsDAO traits converge to reshape a mind, a face, and an entire identity.

The split-face concept reflects dual realities: on one side, the unaware normie with a neutral gaze; on the other, a yield-driven visionary, pixel-shaded and digitally awakened.","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0}],"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"type":"root","version":1}

{"children":[{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"This piece is my playful spin on “Cooking Bad,” mixing the fun and chaos of meme culture with NounsDAO’s pixel personality and a touch of blockchain madness.

In the scene, a Noun-style chef (inspired by Walter White) is cooking up a glowing pot of “Crypto Stew” in a sci-fi kitchen. There’s blue crystal soup, retro lab gear, robot assistants, and little Easter eggs from Nouns, ETH, and Mantle all over.

","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0}],"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"type":"root","version":1}

