A Normie gripped the test tube—Trial Nth. One sip, and everything changed.

The vial pulsed. Stars aligned in Mantle’s shape. Green wicks rose. Coins orbited. Crystals hummed.
Sector 0x1388—Mantle’s Chain ID—opened wide.

I illustrated this moment. Zoom in; a trail to lead you here hides in every pixel, every clue leading you to mET(H)morphosis.
