{"children":[{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"As a child, I'd always been fascinated with surfing and the ocean in general. But sadly I come from a place with limited access to the waves, and to the best of my knowledge, an almost non-existent surfing community ( Maybe I'm just too much of a shut-in to seek out these communities, lol. )

Super Surfer is basically the result of me painting a dream ; My feet planted on a beautiful board, the waves pushing me on from behind, and my mind completely free, suspended in that moment with  nary a care in the world. This piece is a dream that I strive to someday turn into reality.
